<title>NETHERLANDS: NKF NET PROFIT 1996 DFL 44.1 MILLION.</title>
<headline>NKF NET PROFIT 1996 DFL 44.1 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.81 vs   6.03</p>
<p>    Net profit			    44.1  vs  40.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			    1,338   vs 1,213</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    75.7  vs  70.7</p>
<p>Note - Full name is NKF Holding NV.  </p>
<p>NKF said 1996 dividend was set at 2.25 guilders per share.</p>
<p>In 1995 the firm paid a dividend of 10.00 guilders per</p>
<p>share, but last March it announced a 5-for-1 share split, so the</p>
<p>2.25 guilders figure for 1996 compares with 2.00 guilders per</p>
<p>share for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
